      },
      {
       "text": "In January twenty nineteen, a company that rents out office space was valued at forty seven billion dollars.",
       "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "value": 47,
        "prefix": "$",
        "suffix": "B",
        "over": "JANUARY 2019",
        "label": "WEWORK'S VALUATION",
        "color": "gold",
        "size": 240
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "Nine months later, it couldn't even go public.",
